# Card Forge — daily card generation (sized to ~10-20 cards/day for one reviewer)
#
# Install with:  crontab crontab.example   (or paste the line into `crontab -e`)
#
# Adjust the path to your checkout. `uv run` resolves the project venv. Output is
# appended to a log; a non-zero exit (any stage failure) is visible there and to
# cron's MAILTO. Nothing is submitted on failure.
#
# Run once a day at 08:15.

MAILTO=you@example.com

15 8 * * * cd /home/forge/card-forge && /usr/bin/env uv run python forge.py >> /var/log/card-forge.log 2>&1

# Preview without submitting (uncomment to sanity-check the chain hourly during setup):
# 0 * * * * cd /home/forge/card-forge && /usr/bin/env uv run python forge.py --dry-run >> /var/log/card-forge-dryrun.log 2>&1
